{"job_id":"F-c328d99d7e6457da809b","family_id":"F-c328d99d7e6457da809b","title":"중앙선거관리위원회규칙의공포에관한규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":19,"target_id":"6d2e124d1806a29325d1cad23113f0daf7f96ebf626ff218c40ac55f963a4dcc","source_hash":"032533db4c6e971fdcfe283d7ba4fb043cfceefc45e1dbfd5be7bf6dc91dede7","text":"国家选举委员会规则颁布规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":73,"target_id":"8a1921da2199eea70c140110bc5acf4ccc7c216b5b9dc9d2a20747c349f0fb2d","source_hash":"6238f99182f819e1eb9e99329edef35eb1cba96c4aa1ded3a66565b7236d33d9","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定颁布国家选举委员会规则（以下简称“规则”）所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":73,"end":171,"target_id":"5b612f7825f8bcb5d83f50ed25213a1d1d06be6403e9c55f1a6d1b62496fbce6","source_hash":"214352bfd503b87b29ae3a1dcfd4cb4803bdf0b0b0a1f9498113c4deecc75219","text":"文章 2（全文）\n①规则必须包含完整文本。\n② 第1款的序言应说明已获得国家选举委员会的决议，并注明日期，签署文件，并加盖主席印章。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":171,"end":210,"target_id":"de479872cdebaece1e9e1abd9cbfa59494ac25997b55fb086e1dc2b920156d67","source_hash":"b383506ae04aa85cac1b18d4355c449d971bba123da0a4782bb11994634755ca","text":"第三条（公布）规则应当在官方公报上以序号公布。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":210,"end":255,"target_id":"688ba29f1da78bd66e223a671b4ed983572eb0789364b38f5572d7b76e558f22","source_hash":"ab21d8a64da2765c487e2498e5b10e44ee66f3f341d10df707a9f25b8b54c584","text":"第四条（公布日期） 规则的公布日期为刊登该规则的官方公报公布之日。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":255,"end":314,"target_id":"90effc33bf174606a13636f2d08fa15b295f279fe9afffead4a2f7e827b64765","source_hash":"023d99eca46c84fdb2763b6c7ce86ba8c9fd3e7ddaa3f60113954cd46ad8006f","text":"第五条（生效日期）除另有规定外，本规则自公布之日起20日后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006064-36583-ko","scope":"BODY","start":314,"end":355,"target_id":"0cea598d9ae45faa53e7433d0d447aaf1b053c3a259183327886f9d1133627e4","source_hash":"5a54178a521d3f3e36c6ed8e1337ea358ede6b88789dc534da70739095ca49d2","text":"补充规定 <第57号，1987年11月7日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。"}]}